iption":"刘邦，字季，沛丰邑中阳里（今江苏省丰县）人，中国秦末汉初的军事家、政治家，中国汉朝（西汉）开国皇帝，也是中国历史上第一位平民（家世）出身的皇帝，参与以楚国为首的反秦起义，成为诸侯之一。在楚汉战争中，刘邦击败了西楚霸王项羽，统一了自秦朝灭亡后的天下，于公元前202年称帝，建立汉王朝。","link_td_id":"Q10000038","link_td_number_id":21913,"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","people_xingming":"刘邦","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"905a92b8-db0e-11ef-bfa2-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘邦]"},{"link_birth_year":-188,"link_death_year":-141,"link_td_description":"汉景帝刘启，为汉朝皇帝（前157年7月14日－前141年3月9日在位），在位16年，享年48岁，其正式谥号为「孝景皇帝」，后世省略「孝」字称「汉景帝」。为汉文帝刘恒长子，母窦皇后。他在位期间，主要是削诸侯封地，平定七国之乱，巩固中央集权，勤俭治国，发展生产，他和其父亲文帝的统治时期合称文景之治，为中国自大一统以来的首个太平盛世。","link_td_id":"Q10000365","link_td_number_id":90408,"people_name":"孝景皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝景皇帝","people_xingming":"刘启","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"905a92b9-db0e-11ef-9bc3-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘启]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"泰山","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰山","resolved_place_entity_id":306,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"905a92ba-db0e-11ef-a5d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石閭","place_name_jianti_auto":"石闾","place_note":"山東泰安南","resolved_place_entity_id":3973,"start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"905a92bb-db0e-11ef-ad43-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"不其","place_name_jianti_auto":"不其","place_note":"山東青岛北","resolved_place_entity_id":3065,"start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"905a92bc-db0e-11ef-80ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建章宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"建章宫","resolved_place_entity_id":2123,"start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"905a92bd-db0e-11ef-b02a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷三十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"征和四年，复幸泰山修封，亦禅石闾。从来封禅之数，未有如汉...","context_before":"...二年，修封泰山，禅石闾[同上]。天汉三年，行幸泰山修封。","source_end_index":449,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4fb08d4f-c3c0-5b48-be3b-5e70e4f4b948","source_start_index":434,"source_text":"太始四年，幸泰山修封，禅石闾。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷三十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、莱州府（卷三十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后汉属东莱郡。又光武封伏湛为侯邑。其，亦作期。晋咸宁二年...","context_before":"○不其城[县西南二十七里。汉不其县，属琅邪郡。","source_end_index":35,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d75d4b8c-bd31-5081-aea0-4018eee76881","source_start_index":23,"source_text":"武帝太始四年，帝幸不其。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/六、莱州府（卷三十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1春，三月，上行幸泰山。壬午，祀高祖于明堂以配上帝，因受計。癸未，祀孝景皇帝于明堂。甲申，修封。丙戌，禪石閭。夏，四月，幸不其。五月，還，幸建章宮，赦天下。","content_fanyi":"春季三月，汉武帝巡行泰山。壬午日，在明堂祭祀高祖刘邦，以他配享上帝，并在此受理审核各郡国呈报的户口与财政簿册。癸未日，在明堂祭祀孝景帝刘启。甲申日，扩建祭天封坛。丙戌日，在石闾祭祀地神。夏季四月，武帝巡幸不其山。五月，返回长安，驾临建章宫，大赦天下。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，三月，上行幸泰山。壬午，祀高祖于明堂以配上帝，因受计。癸未，祀孝景皇帝于明堂。甲申，修封。丙戌，禅石闾。夏，四月，幸不其。五月，还，幸建章宫，赦天下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1797,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"905a92ae-db0e-11ef-a09d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2冬，十月，甲寅晦，日有食之。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月甲寅晦日，发生了日食。","content_jianti_auto":"2冬，十月，甲寅晦，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1798,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"905a92be-db0e-11ef-a333-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"朔方","place_name_jianti_auto":"朔方","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"905a92c2-db0e-11ef-90bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安定","place_name_jianti_auto":"安定","place_note":"宁夏固原","st